zhige","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banbanzhige/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banbanzhige/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banbanzhige/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banbanzhige/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banbanzhige/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banbanzhige/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banbanzhige/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banbanzhige/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banbanzhige/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","state":"uploaded","size":740,"digest":"sha256:6e5d3a7cc3d85a0087d2bd795dcf5dd030b1130a6bef219c58e368c322285226","download_count":13,"created_at":"2026-10-19T05:02:11Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T05:02:12Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/banbanzhige/DLSS5Tool/releases/download/v3.0.2/SHA256SUMS.txt"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/banbanzhige/DLSS5Tool/tarball/v3.0.2","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/banbanzhige/DLSS5Tool/zipball/v3.0.2","body":"# v3.0.2 Release Notes\r\n\r\n## 优化\r\n\r\n- 关闭增强效果或将强度调为 0 时，自动跳过不需要的增强计算，减少额外资源占用；超分、补帧和 HDR 仍按原设置运行。\r\n- 统一本地 SDR 和 HDR 画面的 GPU 合成，减少重复转换和导出时的画面搬运，大尺寸图片和视频的画面合成更快。\r\n- 连续调节预览参数时复用已有合成资源，减少反复创建和等待，预览能更快跟上设置变化。\r\n\r\n## 修复\r\n\r\n- 修复反复预览后部分资源未及时释放的问题，减少连续使用时的内存占用，并加强内存不足时的保护。\r\n- 修复本地画面合成未跟随增强所选显卡的问题，避免多显卡环境下默认选卡不一致。\r\n\r\n## 下载选择\r\n\r\n- **轻量版**：主程序，不含光流推理组件和模型，适合优先考虑处理速度、先体验基础效果的用户。\r\n- **完整版（full）**：包含主程序、光流推理组件和模型；启用光流可改善连续画面的光影稳定性，但会增加处理耗时。下载全部分卷后合并解压。\r\n- **推理附加包（addon）**：为同版本轻量版补齐组件和模型，补齐后与完整版一致；下载全部分卷，合并后解压到主程序目录，完整版无需重复安装。\r\n\r\n首次使用请核对显卡型号；需要更换运行库时，从 [显卡运行库下载页](https://github.com/banbanzhige/DLSS5Tool/releases/tag/zip) 获取对应文件，关闭程序后将 `nvngx_dlssnr.dll` 放入与主程序同级的 `mods` 文件夹。\r\n"}